# Burritos are collectibles in free skate and runs: placed 1 m over the central island, one is
# picked up by teleporting onto it and rolling, +250, and the burrito goal counts it.
park soma
cmd 0 teleport 39.5 24.5 0.2 90
hold up 6..120
run 200
expect event burrito{n=1} within 1..200
expect no event bail
